That woman looks at me and smiles.
She understands that I am lost.
She walks with me.
We reach the end of that market.
There is a big building in the distance.
She points her finger towards that building.
Then she says to me.
"Do you see that big building?"
"Go straight towards that building."
"Do not turn left on the way."
"Just walk straight."
"Turn right from there."
"Marine Drive is there."
I feel very relieved.
I thank her.
She walks back towards the market.
I walk straight towards that big building.
